[{"title":"修竹馆舍","author":"黄庚","text":"乳燕衔泥春昼长，枕书无梦到高唐。\n桃花红雨梨花雪，相逐东风过粉墙。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8109,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"客怀","author":"黄庚","text":"年年春暮客天涯，愁见东风飏柳花。\n自叹身如梁上燕，营巢长傍别人家。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8110,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"客路","author":"黄庚","text":"春风客路草萋萋，小驻征鞍日又西。\n回首前山云树暗，竹鸡声里鹧鸪啼。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8111,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"宫词","author":"黄庚","text":"闻说君王御宴回，宫人留钥内门开。\n琵琶拨尽黄昏月，不见花间凤辇来。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8112,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"总讲师涅槃台","author":"黄庚","text":"莫将生死视如来，要看莲花火里开。\n勘到灰飞烟灭处，涅槃不是涅槃台。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8113,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"春阴芍药","author":"黄庚","text":"点滴檐声湿径云，翻阶红药带啼痕。\n可怜花片都零落，雨露虽多不是恩。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8114,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"春雨词","author":"黄庚","text":"檐声滴碎玉阑干，开尽梨花亦懒看。\n燕子不归人寂寞，深深宫殿锁春寒。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8115,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"春闺","author":"黄庚","text":"屏山梦断整云鬟，金鸭吹香火未残。\n背倚阑干听燕语，一帘风雨卷春寒。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8116,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"春寒 其一","author":"黄庚","text":"客思重重山色外，诗愁点点雨声中。\n著人料峭东风急，墙角桃花未肯红。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8117,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"春寒","author":"黄庚","text":"春寒料峭透窗纱，睡起晴蜂恰报衙。\n怪得晓来风力劲，满阶香雪落梨花。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8118,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"春寒夜","author":"黄庚","text":"银烛烧残听漏声，春寒诗思觉凄清。\n一庭夜色无人管，分付梨花伴月明。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8119,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"柳","author":"黄庚","text":"腰舞东风未肯休，西风吹叶翠眉愁。\n谁知此是多情树，最爱春光最怕秋。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8120,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"禹庙行春","author":"黄庚","text":"大禹祠前柳色新，骈阗车马斗行春。\n登临都道江山好，话到平成能几人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8121,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"秋池","author":"黄庚","text":"西风吟露冷银塘，菰叶萧疏柳叶黄。\n秋水不知时色老，藕花犹学少年妆。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8122,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"秋色","author":"黄庚","text":"虹影界开微惨淡，雁痕点破更凄清。\n一番雨过天容碧，尽是西风染得成。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8123,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"秋吟 其六","author":"黄庚","text":"满眼秋光动客情，小园闲步杖藜轻。\n黄花憔悴应思晋，才遇渊明香便清。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8124,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"秋吟 其四","author":"黄庚","text":"沦落天涯已白头，西风吹帽冷飕飕。\n悲秋未了悲身世，一样情怀两样愁。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8125,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"秋吟 其一","author":"黄庚","text":"芦花零落点汀洲，白鹭飞边泊小舟。\n水落渔矶风露晓，残荷数点冷擎秋。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8126,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"秋吟二首 其一","author":"黄庚","text":"晓径支筇步屧迟，西风吹露湿秋衣。\n举头凝望青山外，万里江天一雁飞。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8127,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"秋吟二首 其二","author":"黄庚","text":"略彴当门石径斜，槿篱深护野人家。\n炊烟起处江村晚，一片斜阳万点鸦。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8128,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"秋吟 其三","author":"黄庚","text":"秋高风急雁来初，久客松江岂为鲈。\n好梦不成人睡觉，半窗残月夜灯孤。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8129,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"秋声","author":"黄庚","text":"庭外梧桐叶叶风，楼头过雁砌边蛩。\n隔窗砧杵敲残月，唤起乡愁归兴浓。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8130,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"秋夜登西楼","author":"黄庚","text":"清碧金英玉露漙，姮娥深夜不禁寒。\n桂花香里人敲句，倚遍高楼十二阑。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8131,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"秋信","author":"黄庚","text":"豆雨初晴浣溽埃，报凉梧叶堕阶苔。\n一声新雁南楼外，早送西风信息来。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8132,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"秋意","author":"黄庚","text":"庭前梧叶雨晴后，江上荻花风起时。\n凉透书窗人未觉，葛衣竹簟已先知。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8133,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"秋意","author":"黄庚","text":"梧叶翻风敲老树，蛩声带月泣寒莎。\n只消些少闲风月，便觉客窗秋意多。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8134,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"送笔与各庵和尚","author":"黄庚","text":"恨杀毛锥久不灵，特分二辈到禅扃。\n难书八万四千偈，只写波罗一卷经。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8135,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"闺情效香奁体三首 其三","author":"黄庚","text":"懒向妆台对镜鸾，罗衣怯薄正春寒。\n黄金络索珊瑚坠，独立春风看牡丹。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8136,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"闺情效香奁体三首 其一","author":"黄庚","text":"金鸭烟销一字香，满怀春恨强梳妆。\n看花又怕东风恶，偷隔纱窗看海棠。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8137,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"闺情效香奁体三首 其二","author":"黄庚","text":"黛眉愁里敛双蛾，别久无书争奈何。\n欲待怨他还又忆，怨时较少忆时多。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8138,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"闺情效香奁体 其二","author":"黄庚","text":"泪浣香腮粉未乾，相思成病怯春寒。\n此情欲向琵琶诉，整得琵琶又倦弹。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8139,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"闻角","author":"黄庚","text":"谁送寒声入梦中，遥知人在戍楼东。\n明朝梅岭花飞雪，未必都因昨夜风。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8140,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"项羽台","author":"黄庚","text":"失计鸿门恨未消，一生霸业亦徒劳。\n当时漫筑台千尺，争似歌风地步高。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8141,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"夏日陪王君玉汎舟鉴湖","author":"黄庚","text":"波光万顷接天光，画舫归来载夕阳。\n一棹湖心天不暑，万荷风里满身香。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8142,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"莲花亭避暑","author":"黄庚","text":"日火烧空海欲乾，莲宫深处昼生寒。\n佛家一片清凉景，借与诗人尽日看。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8143,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"读秦纪","author":"黄庚","text":"并吞六国独称雄，经籍灰飞烈焰中。\n书外有书焚不尽，一篇圯上汉成功。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8144,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"通玄观","author":"黄庚","text":"云气深深护石坛，红尘飞不到阑干。\n清阴满地无人迹，一径松风鹤梦寒。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8145,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"酒家","author":"黄庚","text":"风飐青帘出杏林，行人未醉瓮头春。\n安知涤器茅檐者，不是相如行辈人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8146,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"酒家","author":"黄庚","text":"风飐青帘挂杏村，田家新酿瓮头春。\n今年米贵无钱籴，买醉衔杯能几人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8147,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"黄庚","text":"渊明觉是新愁少，伯玉知非旧恨多。\n毕竟是非皆一梦，百年梦醒事如何。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8148,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"寄任子忠","author":"黄庚","text":"老去怀人鬓已秋，江山犹带别时愁。\n碧云不隔相思梦，几度吟魂到客舟。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8149,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"寄别方兰室","author":"黄庚","text":"醉下山楼客袂分，杖藜犹带碧阑云。\n归来纸帐眠清夜，半梦梅花半梦君。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8150,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"寄秋山和尚","author":"黄庚","text":"几夜孤吟忆贯休，疏钟敲月动诗愁。\n何人来入匡庐社，分我山中一半秋。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8151,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"寄郭印斋","author":"黄庚","text":"相思何日得相逢，料想君心与我同。\n莫怪近来书寄少，雁飞不肯下秋空。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8152,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"晚春","author":"黄庚","text":"老来无复事狂游，倚杖看花动客愁。\n病骨怯寒春不管，柳棉风里木棉裘。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8153,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"梁燕","author":"黄庚","text":"梁间两处燕成窠，来往衔泥带落花。\n昵昵并头休巧语，相依总在别人家。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8154,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"梅花","author":"黄庚","text":"竹边篱外树封苔，两蕊三花带雪开。\n蜂蝶只贪桃杏艳，嫌花冷淡不飞来。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8155,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"梅菊","author":"黄庚","text":"菊清独占风霜骨，梅白偏宜雪月天。\n晋宋后来爱花者，岂无靖节与逋仙。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8156,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"梦情为懒庵上人赋","author":"黄庚","text":"柏子烟销懒坐禅，白云半榻伴高眠。\n分明记得庄周蝶，飞向梅花雪涧边。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8157,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"萤火","author":"黄庚","text":"化形腐草暗生光，数点随风过野塘。\n窗下久无人夜读，此身不入照书囊。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8158,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"雪居为安上人赋","author":"黄庚","text":"云压西湖水欲冰，雪封楼阁玉棱层。\n夜来门外深三尺，应有齐腰独立僧。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8159,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"黄芙蓉","author":"黄庚","text":"媚色津津散朵芳，道人装束胜红妆。\n诗人若作桃花看，便觉西风不甚凉。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8160,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"黄菊","author":"黄庚","text":"压丛秋色万黄英，多少金风染得成。\n篱下年来无靖节，寒香不似晋时清。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8161,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"寓舍古木无叶","author":"黄庚","text":"桃李门墙万柳青，诗人茅屋独凄清。\n檐前古木无春叶，可怪东风亦世情。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8162,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"谢总讲师惠桂花","author":"黄庚","text":"广寒世界仙家种，金粟如来佛国花。\n多谢高人分惠我，一枝和月到山家。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8163,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"道士夜醮","author":"黄庚","text":"步虚声里碧云飞，佩玉珊珊谒紫微。\n月浸刚风鸾鹤过，仙都道士拜章归。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8164,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"道观即事","author":"黄庚","text":"月到松庭鹤未眠，玄都羽士诵灵篇。\n玉炉烟断瑶坛冷，金磬一声霜满天。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8165,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"新昌大石佛","author":"黄庚","text":"倚天岩石费雕镌，佛相分明在眼前。\n莫与嘉州争大小，法身充满本无边。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8166,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"照瑞宫月夜","author":"黄庚","text":"飞仙挟我上瑶坛，古桂香中夜倚阑。\n铁笛一声吹月落，满身风露不知寒。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8167,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"睡起","author":"黄庚","text":"满阶竹影扫斜阳，一枕秋风桂子香。\n梦里不知身是客，觉来依旧在他乡。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8168,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"简孙治中归维扬","author":"黄庚","text":"闻君骑鹤赋归欤，漫写诗篇问起居。\n后土祠前花在否，平山堂下柳何如。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8169,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"蓬山堂访王鹤隐高士不值","author":"黄庚","text":"蓬莱深处访仙家，云护岩扉石径斜。\n笙鹤未归春寂寂，青鸾啄碎碧桃花。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8170,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"雷潭为定讲师赋","author":"黄庚","text":"缚草为庵枕碧漪，蒲团长是坐禅时。\n一声霹雳惊龙起，布衲蒙头总不知。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8171,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"暮春二首 其二","author":"黄庚","text":"一鸟不啼春寂寂，百花都落雨濛濛。\n十分花鸟东风恨，半在诗中半酒中。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8172,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"暮春","author":"黄庚","text":"园林芳事已阑珊，开尽荼蘼亦懒看。\n深院日长眠听雨，重重帘影隔春寒。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8173,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"暮春二首 其一","author":"黄庚","text":"东风庭院夕阳天，恨绿愁红又一年。\n春自要归花自落，莫将芳事怨啼鹃。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8174,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"暮春 其二","author":"黄庚","text":"柳老黄鹂迁别树，花残粉蝶绕空林。\n道人不管春光去，看了红芳有绿阴。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8175,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"暮景","author":"黄庚","text":"浮云开合晚风轻，白鸟飞边落照明。\n一曲彩虹横界断，南山雷雨北山晴。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8176,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"滴翠松","author":"黄庚","text":"老翠蟠空一样高，月分寒影落庭皋。\n哦诗猛把阑干拍，宿鹤惊飞露湿袍。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8177,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"漫述 其三","author":"黄庚","text":"对客莫谈当世事，闭门且读旧时书。\n蓬莱献赋心犹在，只恐无人荐子虚。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8178,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"漫述 其一","author":"黄庚","text":"百拙懒营生计事，一贫方识丈夫心。\n箪瓢陋巷皆真乐，何用多藏郿坞金。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8179,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"漫述 其二","author":"黄庚","text":"青春易过不多日，白昼得閒能几人。\n有限光阴空役役，堆钱难买百年身。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8180,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"漫述 其七","author":"黄庚","text":"脱巾漉酒心先醉，著屐登山脚便轻。\n豪饮清游忆陶谢，古人千载尚留名。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8181,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"漫述 其十","author":"黄庚","text":"烘柳日高花院暖，炷沉烟冷竹窗虚。\n开编怕见伤怀事，不读离骚读四书。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8182,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"漫述 其六","author":"黄庚","text":"世事艰难如意少，功名荣耀误人多。\n浮云富贵非吾愿，且买扁舟理钓蓑。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8183,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"漫述 其五","author":"黄庚","text":"逢人休要说公卿，老去无心慕宠荣。\n李不封侯刘不第，千年青史亦传名。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":8184,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}}]